BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 113 Tm (the light of a strict consideration, appears to be arbitrary, although it was always tacitly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 100.5 Tm (made even before the introduction of the theory of relativity.) Tj ET
