BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 713 Tm (Let us consider two particular points on the train travelling along the embankment with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700.5 Tm (velocity v, and inquire as to their distance apart. We already know that it is necessary to) Tj ET
