BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 638 Tm (many times as is necessary to take him from the one marked point to the other. Then the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 625.5 Tm (number which tells us how often the rod has to be laid down is the required distance.) Tj ET
