BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 388 Tm (Our train of thought in the foregoing pages can be epitomised in the following manner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 375.5 Tm (Experience has led to the conviction that, on the one hand, the principle of relativity) Tj ET
