BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 175.5 Tm (is given by the Lorentz transformation. Or in brief: General laws of nature are co-variant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 163 Tm (with respect to Lorentz transformations.) Tj ET
