BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 150.5 Tm (or, briefly, relative to every "Galileian" system of co-ordinates. In contrast to classical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 138 Tm (mechanics; the Lorentz transformation is the deciding factor in the transition from one such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 125.5 Tm (system to another.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 100.5 Tm (By means of comparatively simple considerations we are led to draw the following conclusion) Tj ET
