BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 738 Tm (Maxwell: A body moving with the velocity v, which absorbs an amount of energy E0 in the form) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 725.5 Tm (of radiation without suffering an alteration in velocity in the process, has, as a) Tj ET
