BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 400.5 Tm (energy. It is owing to this circumstance that classical mechanics was able to establish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 388 Tm (successfully the conservation of mass as a law of independent validity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 363 Tm ([Note] The equation E = mc2 has been thoroughly proved time and again since this time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 338 Tm (Let me add a final remark of a fundamental nature. The success of the Faraday-Maxwell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 325.5 Tm (interpretation of electromagnetic action at a distance resulted in physicists becoming) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 313 Tm (convinced that there are no such things as instantaneous actions at a distance \(not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 300.5 Tm (involving an intermediary medium\) of the type of Newton's law of gravitation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 275.5 Tm (According to the theory of relativity, action at a distance with the velocity of light) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 263 Tm (always takes the place of instantaneous action at a distance or of action at a distance with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 250.5 Tm (an infinite velocity of transmission. This is connected with the fact that the velocity c) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 238 Tm (plays a fundamental role in this theory. In Part II we shall see in what way this result) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 225.5 Tm (becomes modified in the general theory of relativity.) Tj ET
