BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 150.5 Tm (experiment of Fizeau. The special theory of relativity has crystallised out from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 138 Tm (Maxwell-Lorentz theory of electromagnetic phenomena. Thus all facts of experience which) Tj ET
