BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700.5 Tm (Similarly, the world of physical phenomena which was briefly called "world" by Minkowski is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 688 Tm (naturally four dimensional in the space-time sense. For it is composed of individual events,) Tj ET
